OL,3,GNEWSANeighbourhood may be without
OL,4,Alibrary for 12 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA neighbourhood could be left without a
OL,7,Flibrary for almost a year after talks
OL,8,Ffailed to find a temporary replacement.
OL,10,FKnowle library closed in March over
OL,11,Fsafety concerns at Broadwalk shopping
OL,12,Fcentre on Wells Road, Bristol, which is
OL,13,Fset to be demolished and redeveloped.
OL,15,FResident Peggy Ralph said: "We have
OL,16,Fbeen to meetings where we're told 'it
OL,17,Fwill be a month' and here we are six
OL,18,Fmonths down the line."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
