OL,3,GNEWSANeighbourhood may be without
OL,4,Alibrary for 12 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Bristol City Council
OL,7,Fsaid they are continuing negotiations
OL,8,Fover a temporary location while the
OL,9,Fcommunity waits for a permanent library
OL,10,Fas part of the redevelopment.
